I am at the canal.
I see wide stone steps right by the water.
There is still a free spot.
I sit down on the steps.
It is wonderfully sunny and calm.
I drink my warm coffee and eat my cake.
This is really nice.
The sun feels surprisingly warm on my face.
I am happy and smile.
My heavy green coat is too warm now.
I open my coat.
I also take off my yellow hat.
I put it next to me and look at the water.
Many people are sitting here and enjoying the weather.
So the morning weather forecast was wrong.
It will definitely not rain anymore today.
The afternoon will stay very sunny.
Spring will definitely come soon.
